# Phase review archives.
#
# Each is generated by zipping the tracked pccm/ tree for a submission, so
# committing one would duplicate the entire repository as a binary that goes
# stale on the next source change. Regenerate on demand instead.
#
# The original rule assumed every package was a GATE package. Step packages
# (pccm_phase6_step0.zip) are the same kind of artefact for the same reason,
# so the rule now covers any phase package rather than gate packages alone.
/pccm_phase*.zip
